+# Gold example — Beauty DTC (dual-track)
+
+Filled against the current output template. Synthetic teaching example — not a real brand scrape.
+
+## Ad package
+
+### Brief (locked or assumed)
+- Brand / offer: AuraBarrier Serum — barrier-repair serum, 30ml
+- Niche: beauty
+- Platforms: tiktok, meta
+- Funnel: tof_awareness → mof
+- Production tier: hybrid_polished + premium_cinema twin
+- Virality posture: trend_reactive + brand_film
+- Proof available: [PLACEHOLDER: 2 real reviews]; pack photos assumed on hand
+- Tool access: prompt-handoff (Seedance + CapCut)
+- Assumptions: US English; shade/texture claims cosmetic only
+
+### Retrieval
+- Primary: `pov-day-in-life`
+- Challenger: `beauty-macro-tabletop`
+- Flow: `pov-ritual-benefit-follow`
+- Hooks: pov-identity, macro-lust, confession
+- Trend class: format_meme
+- Niche pack: beauty
+- Swipe-signals: high longevity = before_after + macro + ugc; avoid unsubstantiated clinical claims
+
+### Job-to-be-done
+Make “makeup that lasts a double shift” feel inevitable, then soft-shop the serum.
+
+### Consistency systems
+- Product sheet: filled — frosted glass 30ml, soft dropper, soft sage label, matte cap; no logo melt
+- Character sheet: filled — 20s creator, natural skin, gold hoops, white tee; Soul-ID: candid tired-to-relieved
+- Refs: hero, ¾, label, macro, face front/¾
+
+### Creative stack
+- Pipeline: viral POV + macro cinema twin
+- Primary: Seedance 2.5 omni_reference; CapCut captions
+- Connected: no → handoff
+- LAST-VERIFIED checked: 2026-10-10
+
+### Hooks
+1. POV: your base finally survives a 10-hour shift
+2. BEFORE: midday crease map
+3. Macro: serum catching window light mid-drop
+
+### Timed script (viral 28s)
+| t | Visual | VO / text | Purpose |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| 0–2 | Mirror selfie, AM light | POV overlay | Hook |
+| 2–12 | Commute/desk; serum briefly in bag | sparse | Ritual |
+| 12–22 | Apply + texture macro (sheet lock) | “Only step I don’t skip” | Mechanism |
+| 22–28 | End-of-day mirror | Link in bio | Soft CTA |
+
+### Seedance execution (abbrev)
+```yaml
+tool: seedance
+model: seedance_2_5
+mode: omni_reference
+duration_s: 28
+aspect_ratio: "9:16"
+generate_audio: true
+consistency: { product_sheet: true, character_sheet: true }
+```
+Prompt includes PRODUCT/CHARACTER SHEET LOCK; no clinical claims on screen.
+
+### Dual-track twin
+- Viral: POV ritual
+- Cinema: 12s macro tabletop → pack hero
+- Same JTBD + same product sheet
+
+### AI disclosure & rights
+- Synthetic talent?: no (or disclose if AI)
+- Audio: original bed for paid; trend sound organic-only
+- Proof: [PLACEHOLDER] only
+
+### Self-critique & variants
+| Dimension | Score | Why |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| thumbstop | 5 | POV identity instant |
+| clarity | 4 | Benefit clear by 12s |
+| native_fit | 5 | Feed-native |
+| desire_or_proof | 4 | Texture desire; proof placeholder |
+| cta_hygiene | 5 | One soft CTA |
+| production_truth | 4 | Hybrid honest |
+| consistency_lock | 5 | Sheets + refs |
+
+Failure modes: (1) clinical claim creep (2) shade/SKU landing mismatch (3) overfiltered skin  
+Variants: A silent captions · B add [PLACEHOLDER] review beat · C cinema-first hook for Meta 4:5
+
+### First-time-right QA
+Gates PASS · mistakes rewritten · self-critique yes
